<title>AUSTRALIA: RTRS-Australian 13-week T-note yields 6.610 pct.</title>
<headline>RTRS-Australian 13-week T-note yields 6.610 pct.</headline>
<dateline>SYDNEY 1996-10-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Reserve Bank of Australia said the result of this week's T-note tender was as follows:</p>
<p> 13-week -    Amount	Av. yield   Range	 Previous</p>
<p>		  AS300 million   6.610	 6.40-6.62   6.693</p>
<p>		  (RBA take-up A$300 million, pct allotted at top 84)</p>
<p> 5-week  -    Amount	Av. yield   Range	 Previous</p>
<p>		  AS600 million   6.813	 6.80-6.82   6.867 (Oct 2)</p>
<p>		  (RBA take-up A$300 million, pct allotted at top 43)</p>
<p> 26-week -    Amount	Av. yield   Range	 Previous</p>
<p>		  AS400 million   6.540	 6.53-6.55   6.619</p>
<p>		  (RBA take-up A$300 million, pct allotted at top 45)</p>
<p>-- Sydney newsroom 61-2 9373-1800</p>
